# The HUD's menu, contextMenuStripHud: the right button over the HUD opens it where it came up,
# in the Designer's order - Video, Set Aspect Ratio, User Items, Russian Hud, Swap With Map,
# Ground Color, Battery Cell Voltage, Show icons.
#
# Russian Hud turns hud1.Russian over. Ground Color is CheckOnClick: the first click checks it
# and the ground goes brown, the next unchecks it and the ground goes green. User Items opens
# "Display This"; a box checked asks "Please enter your item prefix", starting at its name and
# ": ", and the item is drawn on the HUD; checked again it comes off. Swap With Map puts the HUD
# where the map was and the map where the HUD was, and again puts them back. The rows not ported
# - Set Aspect Ratio, Battery Cell Voltage, Show icons and the Video drop-down's - are dimmed,
# and a click on one says why on the status line. A press anywhere else closes the menu and goes
# no further.
# `GCSViews/FlightData.Designer.cs:346, 458-566, GCSViews/FlightData.cs:2436-2472, 3122-3139,
# 3185-3271, 4735-4739, 5139-5164, ExtLibs/Controls/HUD.cs:2029-2036`
#
# Needs SITL, so the HUD draws a vehicle and a user item has a value:
#   tools/gui-test.sh tests/gui/fly-hudmenu.gui -- tcp:127.0.0.1:5760

screen fly
window 1600x1200
settle 8

expect fly.hud.menu false
expect fly.swapped false
expect fly.hud.left < 100
expect fly.hud.russian false
expect fly.hud.ground hud
expect fly.hud.items none

# Russian Hud: the flag over, and the menu closed by the click.
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
expect fly.hud.menu true
expect fly.hud.menu.video false
click fly-hud-russian
expect fly.hud.menu false
expect fly.hud.russian true
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-russian
expect fly.hud.russian false

# Ground Color: brown checked, green unchecked.
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-groundcolor
expect fly.hud.ground brown
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-groundcolor
expect fly.hud.ground green

# Video shows its drop-down; its rows and the other three not ported are dimmed and say why.
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-video
expect fly.hud.menu.video true
click fly-hud-recordavi
expect status ~ Record Hud to AVI is not ported
expect fly.hud.menu true
click fly-hud-showicons
expect status ~ Show icons is not ported
click fly-hud-aspect
expect status ~ Set Aspect Ratio is not ported
click fly-hud-batterycells
expect status ~ Battery Cell Voltage is not ported
expect fly.hud.menu true

# A press elsewhere closes the menu and presses nothing else: the header strip stays put.
expect fly.tabs.first 0
click fly-tabs-right
expect fly.hud.menu false
expect fly.tabs.first 0

# User Items: "Display This", a box checked asks its header, and the item is on the HUD.
expect hud.custom.count 0
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-useritems
expect fly.hud.menu false
expect fly.hud.items.open true
expect fly.hud.items.choices > 300
click fly-hud-item-alt
expect fly.prompt Please enter your item prefix
expect fly.prompt.value ~ alt:
click fly-prompt-ok
expect fly.prompt none
expect fly.hud.items ~ alt=alt:
settle 1
expect hud.custom.count 1
# Checked again, it comes off.
click fly-hud-item-alt
expect fly.hud.items none
settle 1
expect hud.custom.count 0
# A header cancelled leaves the box unchecked.
click fly-hud-item-alt
click fly-prompt-cancel
expect fly.hud.items none
click fly-hud-items-close
expect fly.hud.items.open false

# Swap With Map: the HUD where the map was, right of the column, and back again.
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
click fly-hud-swap
expect fly.swapped true
settle 1
expect fly.hud.left > 400
click hud@0.5x0.4:right
expect fly.hud.menu true
click fly-hud-swap
expect fly.swapped false
settle 1
expect fly.hud.left < 100
